---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="">
<Verticalgrid />
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl py-24 lg:px-16 md:px-12 px-8 xl:px-18 items-center lg:py-24 relative w-full">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="mt-8">Key Tools to Boost Repeat Orders</h2>
      <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-4">Points, VIP, referrals, gift cards, and coupons work seamlessly together to create the ultimate rewards program for your business.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mt-16">
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-[#f2f2f7] rounded-3xl">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Stripe gift cards" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-GC.svg">
              <h2 class=" text-2xl mt-8 text-white">Direct Payment Processing</h2>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Connect your Stripe account with 99minds to sell gift cards and handle payments directly, ensuring that sales proceeds are promptly credited to your Stripe balance, facilitating faster payouts according to your configuration.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        

      </div>
     <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-[#f2f2f7] rounded-3xl">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Stripe loyalty" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-LP.svg">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Broad Payment Support</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Our integration supports all major debit and credit cards. Future updates will include compatibility with Apple Pay, Google Pay, and a variety of international payment methods like iDEAL and Alipay, broadening your reach to more customers globally.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-[#f2f2f7] rounded-3xl">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Stripe coupons" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-SC.svg">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Enhanced Security and Compliance</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Leverage Stripe’s robust security infrastructure to safeguard transactional data, paired with 99minds’ commitment to maintaining high compliance standards, ensuring a secure shopping environment for your customers.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>

  </div>
   <div class="flex flex-col justify-center max-w-xl gap-2 mx-auto mt-10 sm:flex-row">
   <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 lg:mt-10">
          <a href="https://giftcard.99minds.io/access/register" target="_blank" class="raise relative p-0.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center font-bold overflow-hidden group rounded-md font-medium">
                <span class="w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ff8a05] via-[#ff5478] to-[#ff00c6] group-hover:from-[#ff00c6] group-hover:via-[#ff5478] group-hover:to-[#ff8a05] absolute"></span>
                <span class="relative px-4 py-2 transition-all ease-out bg-gray-900 bg-opacity-0 rounded-md group-hover:bg-opacity-10 duration-400">
                <span class="relative text-white">Install 99minds for free</span>
                </span>
          </a>
      </div>
      </div>
</section>
